10
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:44,580
So we are at an office today and the receptionist is greeting somebody that has an appointment.

11
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:58,260
All right, let's see what happens.

12
00:00:58,260 --> 00:00:58,520
Good afternoon.

13
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,040
May I help you?

14
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:03,060
Yes, I'm here to see Joanna Stevens.

15
00:01:03,460 --> 00:01:05,540
I have an appointment at four.

16
00:01:05,540 --> 00:01:06,540
Certainly.

17
00:01:06,540 --> 00:01:07,090
May I take your name?

18
00:01:07,630 --> 00:01:08,770
I'll let her know you've arrived.

19
00:01:09,170 --> 00:01:09,470
Sure.

20
00:01:10,260 --> 00:01:14,260
It's Josh O'Neill.

21
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:15,420
Miss Stevens will be with you momentarily.

22
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:17,660
Can I offer you something to drink?

23
00:01:18,380 --> 00:01:19,900
Yes, coffee would be nice.

24
00:01:20,140 --> 00:01:20,280
Thank you.

25
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:29,940
Here you are.

26
00:01:30,740 --> 00:01:32,140
Miss Stevens is ready for you now.

27
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:34,980
I'll show you to her office right this way.

28
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:40,040
Just watch your step here.

29
