82
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:09,500
In a moment.

83
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:11,180
Soon.

84
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:12,180
Soon.

85
00:04:12,180 --> 00:04:19,280
