86
00:04:19,700 --> 00:04:19,900
Yes.

87
00:04:20,340 --> 00:04:23,100
But that's, again, it's not really that polite, right?

88
00:04:23,140 --> 00:04:24,140
Yeah.

89
00:04:24,140 --> 00:04:29,240
So if you want to be formal, you can say, Ms. Stevens will be with you momentarily.

90
00:04:30,320 --> 00:04:30,620
Okay.

91
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:31,980
